WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Standing medium punch begins the demonstrated primer.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.800
Crouching medium punch leads into OD Spinning Bird Kick.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.300
OD Spinning Bird Kick launches Ryu.

4
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.300
Medium Hyakuretsukyaku catches Ryu after OD SBK.

5
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:04.550
Chun-Li jumps forward over Ryu’s knockdown.

6
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.100
Jumping heavy punch reaches the waking Ryu, who guards.

7
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:06.500
Both characters recover after the guarded jump-in.
